cmj2m1dgj00886vqy7glum3f9	cmii1r7rm00006voxkq6fj653	Batpool #1	In Nocturna City, there are no accidents - only orchestrated eliminations.	batpool-1	comics	Chicago, IL	/api/uploads/projects/cmj2m1dgj00886vqy7glum3f9/project/591492273457db18b61b9124e6d5374c.webp	https://youtu.be/VC3sfxRQn38	500	USD	FIXED_DAYS	7	2025-12-20 03:49:07.179	2025-12-13 03:49:07.179	<img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/528/219/cb630a604f2c7206233dbdac0d6233ac_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762247592&amp;width=680&amp;sig=95vfNC7uUILFqm80z0LfLsE5%2FKiuURPzibdBrYlq2nU%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/527/403/6096136336d2be5e86c4c59e59cf03a1_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762242371&amp;width=680&amp;sig=o%2FLWIuUdmjhrPtW99bQCP4E1lKlSPWA6CgislD1Q0F4%3D" alt=""><h3><strong>The Story</strong></h3><h3><strong>Batpool: Bad Luck Charms (28 pages)</strong></h3><p>Welcome to <strong>Nocturna City</strong> - where enhancement serums flow like water, corporate greed masquerades as science, and the line between hero and victim is one bad night away from shattering completely.</p><p>Batpool - Nocturna City's enhanced vigilante, with regenerative healing and detective genius, discovers a series of brutal "accidents" that eliminate enhancement researchers across the city. What begins as a straightforward murder investigation spirals into something far more sinister.</p><p>This is <strong>noir horror meets psychological thriller</strong> that asks the question: <em>What happens when the hunter becomes the hunted?</em> In a world where human enhancement has become the ultimate commodity, and those with powers aren't heroes - they're targets.</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/633/522/750867932874ed21ca929cb3adefe047_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762970195&amp;width=680&amp;sig=PROB4f5RO%2FCwwnefO4iNHhLMULgrLLe2Jzei4vNimKk%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/633/483/2dd2709e97c2c93b1e3c3730913808b1_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762970002&amp;width=680&amp;sig=6dW2%2FVAWtq80FgzJE8KGclPRXRy1rCM7gTSrpVm5A04%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/527/921/a5dc782da8a22b4777be7801efc356e6_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762245318&amp;width=680&amp;sig=u3KLWY4Amr6CQUZQpwFjCf%2Fr31CRFWZ43vhTnHpinqc%3D" alt=""><h3><strong><em>Fun Add-Ons</em></strong></h3><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/513/027/ad037ace6b7016b5e805367dcdddb051_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762163673&amp;width=680&amp;sig=5Jkd5RkK4jhRsamoh85G3QXP0uBUaweb6KRTx3hJM2c%3D" alt=""><p>----------------------------------</p><p><strong>Art Print Sets (11"x17") &amp; Metal Trading Cards Sets</strong></p><p><strong>Clean (below) - <em>16 total (flipbook artwork not included)</em></strong></p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/527/965/0e00a55cc9f778bfc8d647f2ee6a17b9_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762245660&amp;width=680&amp;sig=0FR0SqIgLCNqkX5LE38AFoMhSxodpUcol0rbvS32wtk%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Naughty (below) - <em>13 total (flipbook artwork not included)</em></strong></p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/527/967/4f278486bceeb05308fb342c74cee250_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762245681&amp;width=680&amp;sig=AsGvR2lEWdfMTHYqFmZM64K7ctdsbeJSriey%2BJDqokw%3D" alt=""><p>-----------------------------------</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets