inished or refined but are still fun to look at.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Covers</strong></h3><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/548/c2d798719929a110364731737f33d96e_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781861&amp;width=680&amp;sig=bCFsW0pwYoBRJVCsCnj64c26bnaPh9cjpqfqXLqJ0WU%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/549/2385d45804335039509a9116387dd9af_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781866&amp;width=680&amp;sig=jSjFPzmm2LMylTMPQIduQe%2BhKbDNYJm7zM1cgMSJY0o%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/554/d5a6013476cc6b1f557a9358c84b30f0_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781876&amp;width=680&amp;sig=6h59daODmhcVHv1wfHwNzDEsoHBmCnjU8WYmlxVTUoM%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/555/26588adac15e7767196f2704d468d765_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781880&amp;width=680&amp;sig=YHODOCOHd5riLQFpTsDoeIWro89lGYChG17SWMWHshY%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/556/67f788165c816e500a2dbc78f7de4dbe_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781884&amp;width=680&amp;sig=7Pl1W4IldDYbDFz2NBblUnGCNrkOekMHuO9IeKoO%2B2o%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/559/0ef4c285393c55a8d157cb966b8a8d44_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781889&amp;width=680&amp;sig=5BQrIg1K3ApKLAxQcYhVn5N%2BNqYSDFgezP3sIV4Z1Ps%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/463/561/d7d06ae7f3ef50f9bcc4c135479865a3_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761781