=100&amp;v=1762237823&amp;width=680&amp;sig=EmYaFTHrNINpheNHOoGVpMnpGLVWMSFtRO%2BFK9BHQhI%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/526/486/8b9502af9b83dda13c75988e9e44348d_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762237827&amp;width=680&amp;sig=oDdTvv0Cr14dDFYckM85IhsgvypGUvrXH%2BWhwUQxJaA%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/526/499/5c694655aae8d86a953c21cdb50f33bc_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762237866&amp;width=680&amp;sig=DZMtjS3azPty9OawIFB%2BxCs%2FKMGRTAd5quzLAt8xvGU%3D" alt=""><p>---------------------------</p><h3><strong>Interiors</strong></h3><p>Book has just begun production, more pages will be shown as they complete!</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/512/689/194cf30d29387d94be75d7c6cf7305c2_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762161503&amp;width=680&amp;sig=BL6PaUXt3MhIsLeP%2BHuJKW8%2BhwLtrKOACi2aOxLUJZU%3D" alt=""><h3><strong>-------------</strong></h3><h3><strong>Shipping</strong></h3><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary underline cursor-pointer" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1S8UMda27NcLAQrFk_3RnMNzQCMW4Dlp1S_nC6KYwCv8/edit?gid=0#gid=0"><strong>---&gt; CHECK OUT OUR PROGRESS TRACKER &lt;---&nbsp;</strong></a></p><p><strong>Since May 2023, we have fulfilled many comic books, as well as numerous periodical magazines through our website.</strong></p><p><strong><em>Physical Cut-Off: </em></strong><em>40 days to resend physical orders from the time physical fulfillment starts.</em></p><p>Please stay on top of your email, surveys, and campaign updates to make sure you don’t miss when rewards are sent! If you don’t fill out your survey in a timely manner, we’ll attempt to contact you within that 40-day window.</p><p>-----------</p><h3><strong>About Us</strong></h3><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/446/750/ec7d540a8ebec286088c95520fc1d334_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761686407&amp;width=680&amp;sig=BrILJzdo8f4tzaRiBbrKziO8EiWFV0ylb1Q67CDTnGY%3D" alt=""><p>Divinity Comics is run by the husband-and-wife creative team Mike and Mindy Wheeler, who launched Divinity on Kickstarter in April 2023. Since then, Divinity has grown from Mindy being the sole artist to a team of two to three dozen artists, producing roughly one book a month. Fulfillment is strong and positive, and happy readers are their TOP PRIORITY. They work hard every day to bring you QUALITY comics with fun, entertaining stories, sexy and amusing characters, and rich worlds full of creative energy.</p><p>Divinity Comics is based in the Chicago area. Mike and Mindy have roughly 25 years of combined experience in comics, retail, and shipping (eh, maybe more than that—who's counting, really?). Mike is a lifelong collector, fan, and educated writer, while Mindy has been a lifelong artist with an extensive background in marketing and visual arts. Together, they join forces to form the Divinity powerhouse.</p><p><strong>Collectability</strong></p><p>Divinity is intentionally NOT involved in any comic shop distribution network, so all books here on this site are collectible and retain their value.</p><p><strong>Back Issues</strong></p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/403/bc081a4e58b223def54842c63a3310d9_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983462&amp;width=680&amp;sig=XIxM8Rorjanl1n8wmyiYcmwvfcC6s2%2BRC6e7rktAeU8%3D" alt=""><p>Find all kinds of stories at <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary underline cursor-pointer" href="http://www.divinitycomics.com">www.divinitycomics.com</a>! Below is a description of each of our titles and what to expect from them:</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/478/736/93a2a033a81c974331f8b9bccae35f0f_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761876491&amp;width=680&amp;sig=hLLDlwlFjC%2FpsayewIjynknkcom1V5Nvv12rsDjI5OA%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Lady Darth #1</strong> - Action-packed spin-off series from our "Star Whores" title, launched on Kickstarter! Issue #1 summary: With the seductive Vyxara as her unlikely ally, Lady Darth pursues her prey to the industrial hellscape of Krynn. But when Kael Dravex, a cunning bounty hunter, and Sylvara Korr, a rival from Darth's past, enter the hunt, the mission becomes a deadly game of betrayal, desire, and vengeance.</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/475/573/2fe06334effb655d3e76fdf4728be62d_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761853731&amp;width=680&amp;sig=lz5A9anA0ql2p8s%2BzaJsLSUPmPrwlOiHK8wb8E3VEZE%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Mighty Morphin' Pussy Rangers - </strong>(Adventure) - The Wildest Power Rangers Parody Ever Created! <strong>Issue #1: "Pussy Power Unleashed"</strong> introduces our team, establishes the world of Catropolis, and delivers an explosive 34-page debut that ends with the most epic Puzzyzord battle you've ever seen.</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/412/8c3ab9cf001d80b22347d9ec7570e04a_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983477&amp;width=680&amp;sig=LBnqPiQmLjtQFQbebbMQ2AXb5vsLqQVr0Of6X4XBUxQ%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Surrender The Booty - </strong>(Pirate Adventure) - A mysterious figure known as The Shadow offers Captain Scarlet unimaginable power.</p><p>This book was so much fun. We just finished physical fulfillment on it recently and threw in all kinds of treasure including a gold medallion necklace, gold coins, and a free large movie poster. If you like talking like a pirate, definitely get it on the next campaign for Issue #2 as that is the ONLY way to talk when participating in these campaigns! 🏴‍☠️ <em>Arr!!!</em></p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/413/0c96692781ac68aa8b34ddb5843430e0_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983482&amp;width=680&amp;sig=OX%2BY0%2B%2BToiu%2BbhhmUAN7XcIy0A7W183hKAgnEDaj310%3D" alt=""><p><strong>X-FEM -</strong> (Parody/Satire) - Chaos in the streets of San Francisco! It's up to the X-FEM, a group of colorful freaks of nature to save the day!</p><p>I absolutely love this title and it has FANTASTIC reviews. It's full of badass fun and the interior artist Rodney was born to draw it. X-FEM #2 is launching sometime over the next couple of months and will have little-to-no wait on fulfillment, so get caught up!&nbsp;</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/415/15adf8f3e0da83868dea78aa5a60d80b_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983487&amp;width=680&amp;sig=vPDy38Uj2tv%2B6DQjxLAO8yKpnwUwjxcT56%2BLke%2BUi5s%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Trip Story - </strong>(Parody) Straight outta Gary, IN - Buds Lightyear and Shroomy go on a drug induced adventure.&nbsp;</p><p>This book is very light-hearted and cartoony, Robot Chicken-style. YES - Shroomy is based off of WWE Superstar Matt Riddle and he not only gave us permission for this, but he signed copies for us and we have those proudly slabbed and graded, hanging in our office. :D</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/424/c249bce41aad911e2090ee18423fefd9_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983499&amp;width=680&amp;sig=%2B9%2FujRVLQ3EXU%2FZF%2BwDn1AmxRxjITbtPm5FbgZkI8Kk%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Dead Sexy - </strong>(Dark Horror) A cheerleader returns from the dead to seek retribution.</p><p>Warning - this is a very dark story full of twists and turns. For those Tales of the Crypt type fans.</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/425/6a6ee7a16f61d77bc2a45236eeeaecdc_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983504&amp;width=680&amp;sig=k6p4bFJhCKJiyDpch0HBvYk5Moja4MSENBhQLAjZWW4%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Star Whores -</strong> (Parody/Satire) One of our most popular series!</p><p>These sexy comedy books parody the movies, so Issue #1 is Episode IV: A New Hoe and Issue #2 is Episode V: The Sluts Strike Back. These books inspired the spin-off "Lady Darth", fulfilling soon. Feedback from these books are often along the lines of "I laughed my ass off". So if you like Star Wars, enjoy!</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/429/35dda6fbe6c7221d98e860d7a71b5f5a_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983510&amp;width=680&amp;sig=Dai4kfPQT4NtshQybpp7%2FOi8fQWWLwlPscaSG3dpbHU%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Puppet -</strong> (Supernatural, Detective, Noir) Where Ancient Evil Meets Modern Justice.</p><p>Meet Detective Rebecca Hartman—a skilled homicide investigator, devoted single mother, and widow carrying the weight of personal tragedy. When a series of brutal murders rocks Ellis Falls, New Jersey, Rebecca finds herself investigating crimes that defy explanation. As she delves deeper into the case, she discovers a terrifying truth: these aren't random killings. They're ritualistic summoning's involving otherworldly entities on an ancient mission...</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/475/561/c3b176e9c9913d393e2df22baf827bac_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761853654&amp;width=680&amp;sig=OpbL6I97K5gmovxnujPoznjm3VgEf%2BHufKS3scf%2B0VA%3D" alt=""><p><strong>G-Busters </strong>- (Parody/ Sexy Adventure) Country girl Katie inherits the Playboy Mansion only to discover it's haunted with the ghosts of its previous inhabitants.</p><p>Some of my best work on interiors to date (until <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary underline cursor-pointer" href="https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/boobs-comic/rainbow-the-brute-1">Rainbow The Brute #1 </a>comes out). I love this story, love the aesthetics, love everything about it. We had a BLAST doing glow in the dark covers, monster tongue stickers, and all kinds of ghostly stuff on the original campaign. We're gearing up to launch G-Busters #2 soon, so if you're not caught up on the story yet, now is a great time!</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/475/557/1da833ff81a6676c124d863d765dcf2f_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1761853631&amp;width=680&amp;sig=BpHRtHuCsLqIOq%2BMfy%2Bj%2Bzadh%2F1MJIHt4l4EtMomjm0%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Boobs&nbsp;- </strong>(Industry Satire) An extremely attractive and ditzy Cosplayer can't seem to stay out of trouble despite her enormous assets!</p><p>Little backstory - Boobs #1 was our very first title at Divinity Comics in 2023 (and my first time drawing interiors). :) I've been told it is "Mad Magazine on acid", with South Park style humor. The word "Boobs" is a double entendre as the word also means "stupid people" so we went out of our way to design each character to be extra silly. It's ridiculous fun, pokes fun at the comic book industry in a satirical way, and is not meant to be taken seriously whatsoever which is what makes it awesome.</p><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/331/432/1c45f5cb59944662e32ffecf9162f710_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1760983517&amp;width=680&amp;sig=cSve2Df5kHr3Ps6zxqIjvGI2coEiIex3lgTBCTHgefE%3D" alt=""><p><strong>Sinister Support Servies - </strong>(Comedy) Enter the world of Villain Tech Support, working hard in their cubicles to keep the wheels of evil turning. Inspired by an old comic called "Help Desk", this is a great read for those who love everything bad and also anyone who works in Tech Support. We did a whole series of Villain Motivational Posters on the campaign which now line the walls of our office, of course. You can get one of your own evil motivational posters on our website - they were a huge hit.</p><h3><strong>Thank you, Backers!!!</strong></h3>	This will be our 19th book (or something like that, I've lost count), not including our 8 periodical magazines, and we do not expect any delays. We are very experienced in the creation and fulfillment of comics books, going back over a decade. Should there be, we strive for clear and frequent communication with our backers! You guys are our top priority.\n\n	t	[]	divinitycomicsinc@gmail.com	BUSINESS	STRIPE	t	t	\N	t	<h2>Story</h2><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/528/219/cb630a604f2c7206233dbdac0d6233ac_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762247592&amp;width=680&amp;sig=95vfNC7uUILFqm80z0LfLsE5%2FKiuURPzibdBrYlq2nU%3D" alt=""><img class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-lg my-4 block" src="https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/051/527/403/6096136336d2be5e86c4c59e59cf03a1_original.png?fit=scale-down&amp;origin=ugc&amp;q=100&amp;v=1762242371&amp;width=680&amp;sig=o%2FLWIuUdmjhrPtW99bQCP4E1lKlSPWA6CgislD1Q0F4%3D" alt=""><h3><strong>The Story</strong></h3><h3><strong>Batpool: Bad Luck Charms (28 pages)</strong></h3><p>Welcome to <strong>Nocturna City</strong> - where enhancement serums flow like water, corporate greed masquerades as science, and the line between hero and victim is one bad night away from shattering completely.</p><p>Batpool - Nocturna City's enhanced vigilante, with regenerative healing and detective genius, discovers a series of brutal "accidents" that eliminate enhancement researchers across the city. What begins as a straightforward murder investigation spirals into something far more sinister.</p><p>This is <strong>noir horror meets psychological thriller</strong> that asks the question: <em>What happens when the hunter becomes the hunted?</em> In a world where human enhancement has become the ultimate commodity, and those with powers aren't heroes - they're targets.</p>	{}	mikeisflux@indiecrowdfund.com	\N	mikeisflux@indiecrowdfund.com	\N	t	50	5	\N	LIVE	10878	188	3	2025-12-12 08:33:42.499	2025-12-23 00:42:29.884	2025-12-13 03:49:07.179	\N	comics	graphic-novels	comic-books	t	\N	f	\N	DRAFT
